  message: "Fixed in PR #2298 (merged to dev 308a326ad). A refused setting now says the file may need a newer hypergumbo and names the running version (unknown project- and user-tier keys, merge.prefer_by_attribute, backends.<name>, merge.prefer). LIVE REPRO on dev: .hypergumbo.toml 'withhold_secrets = true' -> hypergumbo sketch /tmp/pr4_fx/unknownkey exits 2 with '... unknown setting 'withhold_secrets'. Known settings: ... This file may need a newer hypergumbo (this is hypergumbo 10.0.0).' Before: the same exit 2 without the last sentence. Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr4/kugah/RESULTS.md."  # 0e04
